  "analysis": [
    {
      "label": "The set-up",
      "text": "Pires carried the ball down the left while Bergkamp drifted to the edge of the box with Dabizas marking tight from behind. A marker that close usually stops a striker from turning."
    },
    {
      "label": "Key moment",
      "text": "As Pires's low pass arrived, Bergkamp flicked the ball around one side of Dabizas with a single touch and spun round the other side. The first touch was also the turn, so no second touch was needed."
    },
    {
      "label": "Why it worked",
      "text": "Dabizas was committed to staying tight, so the defender's weight was pointed the wrong way when ball and striker split. By the time Dabizas recovered, Bergkamp was clean through."
    },
    {
      "label": "The finish",
      "text": "Alone against Given, Bergkamp stayed composed and placed the shot past the keeper rather than striking for power."
    }
  ],
  "captions": [
    {
      "t": 0,
      "text": "Early on at St James' Park, Pires carries it down the left."
    },
    {
      "t": 2.6,
      "text": "Bergkamp drifts to the edge of the box, Dabizas right behind."
    },
    {
      "t": 4,
      "text": "Pires drives a low pass in to Bergkamp."
    },
    {
      "t": 4.8,
      "text": "One touch flicks the ball around one side of Dabizas…"
    },
    {
      "t": 5.5,
      "text": "…while Bergkamp spins round the other side."
    },
    {
      "t": 6.9,
      "text": "Bergkamp's through, with only Given to beat."
    },
    {
      "t": 7.7,
      "text": "Calmly placed past Given. Newcastle 0–1 Arsenal."
    }
  ],
